stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IDLE
    IDLE --> RUN : Left / Right key down
    RUN --> IDLE : All direction keys released
    IDLE --> SLEEP : Idle for 5 seconds
    SLEEP --> IDLE : Space key down
    SLEEP --> RUN : Left / Right key down
    IDLE --> AUTO_RUN : A key down
    AUTO_RUN --> IDLE : 5 seconds elapsed / restore size
    AUTO_RUN --> RUN : Left / Right key down / restore size

    note right of RUN
        One RUN state for both directions
        200 px/s, 100 x 100
    end note
    note right of AUTO_RUN
        Implemented by class AutoRun
        400 px/s, 150 x 150
        No input needed to keep moving
        Reflect at left and right screen edges
    end note
